cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Four Eyes or its evaluation, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Four Eyes: Kernel-enforced limits for in-car AI agents"
abstract: >-
  An in-car AI agent on QNX 8.0 that may only propose vehicle actions: a deterministic gate decides each one,
  and the kernel's security policy keeps the agent off the CAN bus. Includes a labelled attack set and its results.
authors:
